width": 37.39999999999998, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "420", "bbox": {"x": 801.5, "y": 1424.5, "width": 34.0, "height": 17.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "501", "bbox": {"x": 1114.0, "y": 1424.5, "width": 37.40000000000009, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "437", "bbox": {"x": 1253.2, "y": 1424.5, "width": 37.40000000000009, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2654", "bbox": {"x": 1385.7, "y": 1397.3, "width": 54.299999999999955, "height": 27.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Pc, (kbar (n)", "bbox": {"x": 138.8, "y": 1446.9, "width": 96.1, "height": 27.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "362", "bbox": {"x": 336.2, "y": 1451.7, "width": 37.39999999999998, "height": 17.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "213", "bbox": {"x": 468.7, "y": 1451.7, "width": 37.39999999999998, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "173", "bbox": {"x": 631.7, "y": 1451.7, "width": 37.39999999999998, "height": 17.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "143", "bbox": {"x": 801.5, "y": 1451.7, "width": 34.0, "height": 13.599999999999909}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "201", "bbox": {"x": 1110.6, "y": 1451.7, "width": 37.40000000000009, "height": 17.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "364", "bbox": {"x": 1249.8, "y": 1448.3, "width": 40.799999999999955, "height": 23.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "402 249", "bbox": {"x": 1389.1, "y": 1424.5, "width": 40.799999999999955, "height": 44.200000000000045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "9433", "bbox": {"x": 332.8, "y": 1475.5, "width": 50.89999999999998, "height": 23.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7941", "bbox": {"x": 468.7, "y": 1475.5, "width": 47.50000000000006, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7352", "bbox": {"x": 628.3, "y": 1475.5, "width": 50.89999999999998, "height": 23.799999999999955}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "6546", "bbox": {"x": 801.5, "y": 1475.5, "width": 44.200000000000045, "height": 17.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7870", "bbox": {"x": 1110.6, "y": 1475.5, "width": 50.90000000000009, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "9663", "bbox": {"x": 1249.8, "y": 1475.5, "width": 50.90000000000009, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "7725 [a] Impact sensitivity (BAM drophammer (1 of 6)). [b] Friction sensitivity (BAM friction tester (1 of 6)). [c] From X-ray diffraction analysis recalculated to 298 K. [d] Nitrogen content. [e] Oxygen balance towards CO formation [f] Oxygen balance towards CO2 formation [g] Temperature of endothermic event (DTA; ß= 5°C min™\"). [h] Temperature of exothermic event (DTA; ß = 5°C min). [i] Calculated enthalpy of formation. [j] Calculated mass related enthalpy of formation. [k] Energy of explosion. [I] Detonation temperature. [m] Volume of detonation products (assuming only gaseous products). [n] Detonation pressure at Chapman-Jouguet point. [o] Detonation velocity. [p] Density measured pycnometrically.", "bbox": {"x": 135.8, "y": 1469.9, "width": 1368.8000000000002, "height": 172.39999999999986}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "minor reduction of the detonation velocity (8405 ms) and detonation pressure (269 kbar) compared to 5-ATO (8609 ms, 298 kbar). While the impact sensitivity of 1 (10 J) is comparable to that of 5-ATO (10 J), the friction sensitivity is higher for 1 (28 N) than for 5-ATO (108 N), meaning 1 is more sensitive towards external stimuli than 5-ATO. In contrast, the hydroxylammonium (6) salt of 1-hydroxy-5H-tetrazole shows a higher heat of formation (259 kJ mol-' (6)) compared to the corresponding salt of 5-ATO (Hxt: 227 kJ moliỊ). Compound 6 shows a very high detonation velocity (9284 ms) compared to compound 5 (8013 ms), which is due to the higher density of", "bbox": {"x": 125.7, "y": 1716.9, "width": 692.8, "height": 360.2999999999997}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Chem Asian J. 2021, 16, 3001 - 3012", "bbox": {"x": 129.1, "y": 2118.0, "width": 288.69999999999993, "height": 20.40000000000009}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "www.chemasianj.org", "bbox": {"x": 461.6, "y": 2115.1, "width": 201.10000000000002, "height": 27.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "6 1.67 g cm-3 (5: 1.40 g cm 3). Although compound 7 shows a slightly lower density (1.60 g cm-3) than compound 6, the significantly higher enthalpy of formation of 7 (346 kJmol-') results in its even higher detonation velocity of 9437 ms- Compounds 6 and 7 both outperform even HMX in terms of detonation velocity. While compound 5 is completely insensitive (IS > 40 J, FS > 360 N), compounds 6 (IS = 6 J, FS 240 N) and 7 (IS = 26 J, FS > 360 N) show higher impact sensitivities, but crucially, are comparable to (6) or less sensitive (7) than HMX. The monohydrate sodium salt (2) is completely insensitive towards external stimuli, whereas the potassium (3) salt is more", "bbox": {"x": 838.9, "y": 1710.1, "width": 686.1999999999999, "height": 364.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "3008", "bbox": {"x": 794.7, "y": 2114.6, "width": 57.700000000000045, "height": 23.800000000000182}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "© 2021 The Authors. Chemistry - An Asian Journal published by Wiley-VCH GmbH", "bbox": {"x": 1005.3, "y": 2118.0, "width": 520.1000000000001, "height": 45.90000000000009}}], "ms": 378.09}